{"id":"rupture","lemma":"rupture","pos":"noun","rank":2417,"glosses":["breakup, rupture"],"ipa":"/ʁyp.tyʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e5/Fr-rupture.ogg/Fr-rupture.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ruptures"},"examples":[{"text":"C'est une simple rupture de contrat.","en":"That's simple breach of contract.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"simple"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"contract"}]},{"text":"Désolé, le livre est en rupture de stock.","en":"Sorry, the book is out of stock.","words":[{"g":"sorry"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"book"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"in stock"]]},{"text":"Je suis désolé, mais nous sommes en rupture de stock.","en":"I'm sorry, but we're out of stock.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"sorry"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[8,10,"in stock"]]},{"text":"Les jeans sont en rupture de stock.","en":"We're sold out of jeans.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"a pair of jeans","l":"jean"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"in stock"]]},{"text":"J'ai bien peur que nous soyons en rupture de stock.","en":"I'm afraid we're out of stock.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"well"},{"g":"fear"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[9,11,"in stock"]]}]}